<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Şifre Sıfırlama — BAM</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #0a0a0a;">

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#0a0a0a" style="background-color: #0a0a0a;">
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="background-color: #0a0a0a;">

            <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width: 520px; text-align: left; background-color: #0a0a0a;">

                <tr>
                    <td style="padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 40px;">
                        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="middle" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; background-color: #eab308; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; color: #121212; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;">

                                </td>
                                <td valign="middle" style="padding-left: 16px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;">
                                    BAM
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td style="background-color: #171717; border: 1px solid #333333; border-radius: 20px; padding: 48px 40px; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;">
                        <div style="font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1;">🔑</div>

                        <h1 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Şifre Sıfırlama Kodunuz</h1>

                        <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 40px 0; line-height: 1.7;">
                            Merhaba{% if user is defined and user.firstName is not empty %} <strong style="color:#ffffff">{{ user.firstName }}</strong>{% endif %},<br>
                            BAM hesabınızın şifresini sıfırlamak için aşağıdaki kodu kullanın.
                        </p>

                        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" style="margin: 0 auto;">
                            <tr>
                                {% for char in code|split('') %}
                                    <td align="center" valign="middle" style="width: 54px; height: 64px; background-color: #121212; border: 1px solid #eab308; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #eab308; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;">
                                        {{ char }}
                                    </td>
                                    {% if not loop.last %}
                                        <td style="width: 12px;">&nbsp;</td>
                                    {% endif %}
                                {% endfor %}
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 40px; background-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.15); border-radius: 12px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.7;">
                                    <strong style="color: #eab308; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">⏱ Bu kod 2 dakika geçerlidir.</strong>
                                    Kodu kimseyle paylaşmayın. BAM ekibi sizden hiçbir zaman bu kodu istemez. Bu işlemi siz yapmadıysanız bu e-postayı görmezden gelebilirsiniz.
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 80px; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.8; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;">
                        <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Bu e-posta <strong style="color:#9ca3af">BAM Sistem</strong> tarafından otomatik gönderilmiştir.</p>
                        <p style="margin: 0;">Lütfen bu adrese yanıt vermeyin.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>